                                          |
                                       IRLZ44N (drain) --> bornera p2
                                          |                    ^
                                          |     1N4148 al /12V-+  (rueda libre)
                                          |     LED + R 1K al /12V (testigo Y PULL-UP)
                                       GND (source)
```

